### Production Considerations
- **Security**: Never log sensitive configuration values
- **Validation**: Always validate configuration against schema
- **Environment Isolation**: Separate configs for dev/staging/prod
- **Encryption**: Encrypt sensitive values in storage
- **Monitoring**: Track configuration changes and reloads

### Anti-Patterns to Avoid
- ❌ Storing secrets in plain text configuration files
- ❌ No validation of configuration values
- ❌ Mixing environment-specific and general configuration
- ❌ No fallback values for required settings
- ❌ Logging sensitive configuration values

